Package: local-image-tools
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Local Image Tools contributors <noreply@localimagetools.invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgl1, libegl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Offline local image compression, resizing and conversion
 A native desktop workspace and command-line tool for local image processing.
 No account, cloud processing, telemetry, or automatic updater is required.
